            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zapisz największy zysk osiągnięty w ciągu ostatnich czterech tygodni w zmiennej <code>max_profit</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"weekly_profits = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"70\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"max_profit = max(weekly_profits)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(max_profit)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"66\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"70\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>max_profit</code>, następnie <code>=</code> i na końcu <code>max(weekly_profits)</code>.</p></body></html>",
